OL,3,GNEWSAAncient bridge to close for five
OL,4,Adays for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn ancient bridge that was damaged in a
OL,7,Fcrash will close for five days for
OL,8,Frepairs.
OL,10,FAbout 32.8ft (10m) of heritage
OL,11,Fstonework was knocked into the river
OL,12,Fbelow Nether Bridge in Kendal when a
OL,13,Fcar struck it in June, with a man
OL,14,Farrested on suspicion of dangerous
OL,15,Fdriving soon after.
OL,17,FThe bridge will be closed to all
OL,18,Fvehicles until Friday at the latest to
OL,19,Fallow the section of the southern
OL,20,Fparapet wall to be rebuilt.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
