OL,3,GNEWSAAncient bridge to close for five
OL,4,Adays for repairs
OL,5,
OL,6,FWestmorland and Furness Council said
OL,7,Fthe original stonework recovered from
OL,8,Fthe river would be used, supplemented
OL,9,Fby locally sourced stone where
OL,10,Fnecessary.
